==Description==
The '''Bubbles Nametag''' is a nametag that is obtained by completing the ''Raft Wars'' [[Mission Quests|Mission]].

The '''Bubbles Nametag''' has purple to blue gradient text with a similarly colored outline. Multiple bubbles particles appear out of the text, which start out as blue before shifting its colors to purple and then yellow. It also has a unique font.

